---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import teamCherry from "../assets/brand/team-cherry.png";
import divider from "../assets/ornament/divider-top.png";
import { SOCIAL } from "../data/stores";
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer__inner">
    <Image src={divider} alt="" class="footer__orn" width={440} densities={[1, 2]} loading="lazy" />
    <a class="footer__tc" href="https://www.teamcherry.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <Image src={teamCherry} alt="Team Cherry" width={200} densities={[1, 2]} loading="lazy" />
    </a>
    <nav class="footer__links" aria-label="공식 채널">
      <ul role="list">
        {
          SOCIAL.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                {s.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <p class="footer__legal">
      Hollow Knight, Hollow Knight: Silksong 및 이 페이지에 쓰인 모든 이미지·영상·음악의 권리는 Team Cherry와 각 저작권자에게 있습니다. 이 사이트는
      Team Cherry와 관계없는 비영리 팬 프로젝트입니다.
    </p>
    <p class="footer__made">
      2020년 첫 포트폴리오 → 2026 리마스터 ·
      <a href="https://github.com/tjsrjs8282/HollowKnight" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
    </p>
    <p class="footer__stack">Astro · GSAP · Lenis · Web Audio · Gemini · ElevenLabs · fal.ai</p>
    <a class="hk-btn footer__top" href="#top">처음으로</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(56px, 10vh, 120px) 0 clamp(36px, 6vh, 64px);
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgb(10 14 24 / 0.6));
  }
  .footer__inner {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .footer__orn {
    width: min(440px, 80vw);
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .footer__tc :global(img) {
    width: 92px;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.7;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .footer__tc:hover :global(img) {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .footer__links ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px 26px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .footer__links a {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--pale-3);
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .footer__links a:hover {
    color: var(--pale);
  }
  .footer__legal {
    max-width: 46em;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--pale-4);
  }
  .footer__made,
  .footer__stack {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--pale-4);
  }
  .footer__made a {
    color: var(--pale-3);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .footer__stack {
    font-family: var(--font-display-stack);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }
  .footer__top {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
